# Force HTTPS: instruct browsers to only ever connect over TLS (mirrors the
# marketing site). The HTTP→HTTPS redirect itself is the Cloudflare zone
# "Always Use HTTPS" setting.
#
# Content-Security-Policy (2026-10-12), enforced. What the app really reaches
# for, and nothing else (the same recipe as Universal PDF):
#   • script-src: its own bundle; the inline pre-paint theme script in
#     index.html, by its sha256 (scripts/theme.test.mjs fails if the script
#     changes without this hash following); Google's sign-in script (the SDK
#     loads accounts.google.com/gsi/client on demand). No 'unsafe-inline', no
#     'unsafe-eval'.
#   • style-src 'unsafe-inline': React style attributes, everywhere.
#   • connect-src https:: "Check link" fetches whatever https address the user
#     typed (only when they press the button), so it cannot be a list. The
#     rest: Supabase (API, auth, storage, realtime over wss), the suite
#     changelog, hosted-file storage, the organisation icon, Google sign-in.
#   • img-src https:: logos and avatars come from wherever a user points.
#   • worker-src 'self' blob:: the service worker, and Supabase realtime's
#     heartbeat worker (a blob: URL).
#   • frame-src: Google sign-in only.
#   • No Cloudflare Web Analytics. Cloudflare's zone-level automatic setup
#     injects its beacon (static.cloudflareinsights.com) into the live HTML;
#     script-src does not allow it, so it never runs. Turn the injection off for
#     this host in Cloudflare (Web Analytics site rules) to stop the refused
#     request showing in the console.
# The dev server serves the same policy Report-Only (vite.config.ts, cspDev()).
#
# Hardening. Nothing in the suite frames this app, so refusing to be framed
# elsewhere costs nothing and closes off click-jacking the account actions.
# No Permissions-Policy: Scan needs the camera.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-FtDnvSmT5Vrsm+ymcKT5zBykbhPsujlxqj7YKNf/RRs=' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/style; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' data: blob: https: wss://rygfxgalojojppxmhddo.supabase.co; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-src 'self' blob: https://accounts.google.com/gsi/; media-src 'self' blob: data:; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'
